WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.900
A Famagan ne a Gwiriko. Bãngr-gomdã yaa bũmb sẽn zĩnd pĩnd wẽndẽ wã, la d tõe n yeelame tɩ yaa vẽenega.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.304
Yʋʋm kob-gĩnd piig la a nii wã pʋgẽ, Kong ra yaa tẽn-kãsenga.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.040
A Ouattara yʋʋr sẽn boond t'a Maamã zãada so-pakdb n kẽng be.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.728
A zãmsda bãmb tɩ b tʋk ne sʋʋs la b wẽnemd b poorẽ, n pʋʋsd ne zabr sʋʋse.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.538
Daar a ye, a rɩka a tãb-biisã taoore. Yaa sor-kãsenga.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.112
B kẽeda tẽn-bɛdse, la kʋɩlgã pʋga, n ka bas ye.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.610
Yaa b sẽn be Bobo soolmẽ wã. Tẽnga zoe n tara a zu-soben-dãmba.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.903
Mam waame n na n pʋʋs foom, tẽng kãngã gũud.

00:01:46.903 --> 00:01:49.400
Yãmb yaa zo-rãmb bɩ karen-saam-dãmba?

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.508
Yaa a Zeova zoa.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.538
B sã n dɩk zabr sʋʋgã, b naaga tẽngã barkã. Yaa kaool la b maan-yã.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:16.946
La pa ned kam fãa n sak woto ye. Neb nins sẽn zabd ne-a wã rɩka b sɩbgrã.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.008
Yaa tʋʋm-kãsemse, la koe-moondmã yaa toog wʋsgo.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.248
M na n kõo m menga.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:41.274
Ned ning sẽn zabd ne-a wã basa a zab-teedã. Ned ka leb n zabd ne a Famagan ye.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.760
B sẽn gũbg a Bobo wã, Gwiriko soolmã rogame.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:05.528
Tẽnga na n yɩɩ bãane, la a sorã na n yɩ vẽenega.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:17.594
B yeel-b lame tɩ b na n sãama tẽngã. Rẽ n so t'a Zeova nin-buiidã na n paama sũ-noogo.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:38.418
Zĩ-kãsemsã ra yaa wʋsgo. Koɛɛgã, futã la zu-loees ra lebgdame n paasdẽ.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:09.024
Baa rũndã-rũndã, Bobo-Dioulasso Ouattara rãmbã ket n tẽra gom-kãensã.
